  "title": "Studio observed v3 locator: closed, exact-only grammar, synthesized and verified by the runner",
  "description": "An array of at most 8 steps applied left to right from the page. Also enforced by the runner validateLocator (not expressible in draft-07): nth only as the last step, filterHas never first, and at most 8 steps counting the steps inside filterHas.",
